cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the methodology described in
  docs/technical_disclosure.md and docs/research_gap.md, please cite it as
  below. This is a research/engineering project, not a peer-reviewed
  publication — see docs/results.md for the exact experimental methodology
  and honest, unrounded results behind every reported number.
title: >-
  SIGNUM: A Multi-Modal (Static + Dynamic) Signature Verification System
  with Cross-Attention Fusion, Cooperative-MARL-Explored Decision Fusion,
  and Forensic Calibration
authors:
  - name: "Uttpal Tripathy"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Uttpal-Tripathy/signature-verification-system"
license: Apache-2.0
type: software
keywords:
